#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/omr-adblock/settings.js:158
msgid ""
"Blocks ads, trackers and malware domains in dnsmasq. The lists are "
"downloaded, merged and kept compressed in RAM; dnsmasq unpacks them when it "
"starts."
